{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37744","headline":"所知从事近藩偶有怀寄 · 郑谷","name":"所知从事近藩偶有怀寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官舍种莎僧对榻，生涯如在旧山贫。\n酒醒草檄闻残漏，花落移厨送晚春。\n水墨画松清睡眼，云霞仙氅挂吟身。\n霜台伏首思归切，莫把渔竿逐逸人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37744.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37744","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}